  "description": "Seeded, hard-edged rectangular image fragments jump along a rotatable glitch axis, with per-fragment angle variation for less mechanical digital break-up. Density controls the proportion of corrupted cells; Displacement sets the maximum pixel shift; Angle rotates the fragment grid; Angle Scatter independently varies each active fragment’s movement direction. Band Height and Fragment Width set block geometry; RGB Separation offsets red and blue; Micro Tear adds smaller discontinuities. Seed locks a repeatable pattern and Effect Mix blends with the original. Nearest-neighbour wrapped sampling creates deliberate boundary seams. Source alpha is unchanged. Suitable for poster typography, portraits and signal-corruption graphics.",
